{"id":194,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><style>@font-face{ font-family:\"Times New Roman\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"宋体\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Wingdings\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"Arial\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"方正小标宋简体\";} @font-face{ font-family:\"仿宋\";} p.MsoNormal{ mso-style-name:正文; mso-style-parent:\"\"; margin:0pt; margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:none; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-family:'Times New Roman'; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; font-size:12.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} h2{ mso-style-name:\"标题 2\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-next:正文; margin-top:13.0000pt; margin-bottom:13.0000pt; mso-para-margin-top:0.0000gd; mso-para-margin-bottom:0.0000gd; page-break-after:avoid; mso-pagination:lines-together; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; mso-outline-level:2; line-height:172%; font-family:Arial; mso-fareast-font-family:宋体; mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman'; mso-ansi-font-weight:bold; font-size:14.0000pt; mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;} span.10{ font-family:'Times New Roman';} span.msoIns{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:underline; text-underline:single; color:blue;} span.msoDel{ mso-style-type:export-only; mso-style-name:\"\"; text-decoration:line-through; color:red;} table.MsoNormalTable{ mso-style-name:普通表格; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-padding-alt:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt; mso-para-margin:0pt; mso-para-margin-bottom:.0001pt; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-family:'Times New Roman'; font-size:10.0000pt; mso-ansi-language:#0400; mso-fareast-language:#0400; mso-bidi-language:#0400;} @page{mso-page-border-surround-header:no; mso-page-border-surround-footer:no;}@page Section0{ margin-top:72.0000pt; margin-bottom:72.0000pt; margin-left:90.0000pt; margin-right:90.0000pt; size:595.3000pt 841.9000pt; vsb_temp:15.6000pt; mso-header-margin:42.5500pt; mso-footer-margin:49.6000pt;} div.Section0{page:Section0;}</style><div><p>为强化学生资助诚信教育，规范助学贷款管理，夯实资助育人成效，2026年6月4日晚19：30，我院在17202H组织开展资助诚信教育专题宣讲会。本次宣讲围绕助学贷款政策、还款征信规范、资助纪律要求及励志榜样引领等重点开展，全面提升学生的资助认知与诚信素养。<br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iMlrDkUmvZMzM7LsmQ2UlliUNUsolrZVM7U4Lz9aUzQVnm-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yPn1h7MkysL7rkUm7aLmCiL77iUNWVM46RUzNYUmCYLlnFnN7Zo77PM46FLmrfLmvJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzNaoR9Jqdbnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=19088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/61FD470EBB102650A5BBE77CA92B621D/FA88A177/25A27\" vheight=\"415\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iMlrDkUmvZMzM7LsmQ2UlliUNUsolrZVM7U4Lz9aUzQVnm-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yPn1h7MkysL7rkUm7aLmCiL77iUNWVM46RUzNYUmCYLlnFnN7Zo77PM46FLmrfLmvJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzNaoR9Jqdbnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=19088&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>李静老师现场解读资助育人核心精神，阐释资助政策的初心与意义，鼓励学子心怀感恩、笃行实干，将关爱转化为成长动力。</p><p>勤工委负责人系统解读国家助学贷款核心政策，重点介绍生源地助学贷款毕业确认流程、还款规则、还款渠道及关键时间节点，普及贷款申办、履约还款全流程知识，帮助学生扫清政策认知误区，精准掌握助学贷款相关规范要求。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iU4vDDM7WkUmG4LsRUPnzUaM7UPL87ZiMNWko7V2Um9Yn7U0gihFp2hmCIa0USyioSyDMkh7nN-YL8M2U4QVnm7YLmGDLNVkLRl4M7UYozWFL4TkolliU8VFLllDLN7Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzNaoR9Jqdbnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=19088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A5964DFB23CFC6EF122062AB0534D292/39B9E5CA/1E62A\" vheight=\"415\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iU4vDDM7WkUmG4LsRUPnzUaM7UPL87ZiMNWko7V2Um9Yn7U0gihFp2hmCIa0USyioSyDMkh7nN-YL8M2U4QVnm7YLmGDLNVkLRl4M7UYozWFL4TkolliU8VFLllDLN7Jv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzNaoR9Jqdbnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=19088&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>针对毕业贷款学生，开展专项重点提醒，明确毕业确认线上操作规范与毕业后还款周期、本息核算等关键内容。同时，着重讲解贷款逾期的严重后果，详细说明不良征信记录对个人升学、就业、信贷生活等方面的终身影响，引导毕业生树立诚信履约意识，自觉维护个人征信。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=inlVDVMRCYU8l4nsRM2M7-ZMm7ZLmQZ7MmLZM4QRozTkUm-0gihFp2hmCIa0LSyan1hVL1yZnmlbo77ZLNlanmMVnzNYM4fkMR6VM8-4UmAFM4f2MRW2nmfFLz7PMR78gjfJQ4Oeo4xmp2xZ_I6m_dN0qIbtpYyPLmLsg47bLR9ZgtA8pUbcc&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=19088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/10FE28F598A82E0F3EE9270B47E7B3B8/70F42FF0/111414\" vheight=\"414\" vwidth=\"552\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iLl-DsUz7snzn7MsRn7MRUaUz6fnRAZ7o7U4U4-ZolV7nzU0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyaokhkLkhRM7-anRQRUl7YM4TRMmU4MRf7nRQkL8CDn7MFnlVRnRUZMzWFLNC4MmLZgjfJQ4Oeo4xmp2xZ_I6m_dN0qIbtpYyPLmLsg47bLR9ZgtA8pUbcc&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=19088&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>为深化资助育人效果，我院深挖受助学生励志成才先进典型，本次活动邀请优秀学生23030Z01班李宇航同学分享励志成长经历，为同学们树立鲜活榜样。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=inzNDDoRUbUNLsLs4r7Uz7iUNVVoR-Z8Mz-8o7VVL7UZozG0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h2n1ybLSyZnmG8nN7iL4L4L7MVozfkoRlbn7-aoRf2LmVFnlnVoRTkn7rFLmUYL8UJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzNaoR9Jqdbnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=19088&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2FF918F04FA53330CE90B859DB080F21/EDE89BDE/2423D\" vheight=\"415\" vwidth=\"553\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=inzNDDoRUbUNLsLs4r7Uz7iUNVVoR-Z8Mz-8o7VVL7UZozG0gihFp2hmCIa0L1h2n1ybLSyZnmG8nN7iL4L4L7MVozfkoRlbn7-aoRf2LmVFnlnVoRTkn7rFLmUYL8UJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzNaoR9Jqdbnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=19088&e=.png\">&nbsp;</p><p>此次活动有效普及了资助诚信知识，筑牢了学生诚信思想防线。下一步，我院将常态化开展资助诚信、励志感恩教育，持续发挥榜样示范引领作用，构建“受助—成才—反哺”的良性育人循环，引导受助学子砥砺奋进、锤炼本领，以青春之力回馈社会、不负栽培。</p><p>&nbsp;</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://3y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iMlrDkUmvZMzM7LsmQ2UlliUNUsolrZVM7U4Lz9aUzQVnm-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1yPn1h7MkysL7rkUm7aLmCiL77iUNWVM46RUzNYUmCYLlnFnN7Zo77PM46FLmrfLmvJv2bjo4OeoDMOqsAbQDMZ_ShXptQ0g47YL4v0LzNaoR9Jqdbnx&oid=1073042095&tid=1237&nid=19088&e=.png"}